                    <p class=MsoNormal><span style="font-family:仿宋;mso-bidi-font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:12.0000pt;
mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;"><font face="仿宋"><p>This course is the experimental component paired with the organic chemistry major course. It serves as an extension of&nbsp;&nbsp;Experiments in Organic Chemistry I course and is a mandatory professional course for undergraduate students majoring in Pharmacy. The course content not only covers fundamental operations in organic chemistry experiments, but also encompasses complex procedures as well as organic synthesis reactions involving both single-step and multi-step processes.</p></font></span><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-font-family:仿宋;font-size:10.5000pt;
mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;"><o:p></o:p></span></p>
                </td>
            </tr>
